{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用“最远可达下标”概括已经扫描过的所有跳法：只要当前下标仍在可达范围内，就用它尝试扩大边界。示例 1 的边界最终覆盖末尾，因此返回 true；示例 2 的边界停在下标 3，无法继续扫描到下标 4，因此返回 false。动画逐步展示当前下标、单点可跳范围和全局最远边界。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>跳跃游戏可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .intro { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 10px; color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }\n  .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 3px; }\n  .dot.current { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .dot.reachable { background: #26384a; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .case { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .case-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .case-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; }\n  .result { padding: 2px 7px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .result.done-true { color: #b8e6c1; border-color: #3f8f55; background: #23432c; }\n  .result.done-false { color: #f0b5b5; border-color: #a84d4d; background: #4a2929; }\n  .array { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .cell { width: 38px; min-height: 48px; padding: 4px 2px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; text-align: center; transition: .3s; }\n  .value { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .index { margin-top: 2px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .marker { min-height: 12px; margin-top: 2px; color: transparent; font-size: 10px; }\n  .cell.reachable { background: #26384a; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .cell.current { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: white; }\n  .cell.blocked { background: #3a2929; border-color: #875050; }\n  .cell.target { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px #3794ff; }\n  .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .stat { padding: 8px 10px; background: #1c1c1c; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; }\n  .stat-label { color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .stat-value { margin-top: 2px; color: #3794ff; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; }\n  .track { margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .track-label { margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .bar { display: flex; gap: 4px; }\n  .segment { flex: 1; height: 3px; border-radius: 3px; background: #3c3c3c; transition: background .3s; }\n  .segment.on { background: #3794ff; }\n  .message { padding: 8px 10px; background: #252526; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; font-size: 12px; }\n  .foot { color: #8d8d8d; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px dashed #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  code { color: #9cdcfe; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12px; }\n  @media (max-width: 520px) { .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>跳跃游戏：维护最远可达边界</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">依次检查可达位置，不必真的选择一条跳跃路线。当前格能把边界推得多远，就更新到多远。</p>\n  <div class=\"legend\">\n    <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"dot current\"></span><span>当前检查</span></div>\n    <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"dot reachable\"></span><span>最远边界内</span></div>\n    <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>尚不可达</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"case\" id=\"case-a\">\n    <div class=\"case-head\"><div class=\"case-title\">示例 1：<code>[2,3,1,1,4]</code></div><div class=\"result\">判断中</div></div>\n    <div class=\"array\"></div>\n    <div class=\"stats\">\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-label\">当前下标 i</div><div class=\"stat-value current-index\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-label\">本格可到 i + nums[i]</div><div class=\"stat-value local-reach\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-label\">全局最远可达</div><div class=\"stat-value farthest\">0</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"track-label\">全局可达范围</div><div class=\"bar\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"message\">准备从下标 0 开始。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"case\" id=\"case-b\">\n    <div class=\"case-head\"><div class=\"case-title\">示例 2：<code>[3,2,1,0,4]</code></div><div class=\"result\">等待演示</div></div>\n    <div class=\"array\"></div>\n    <div class=\"stats\">\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-label\">当前下标 i</div><div class=\"stat-value current-index\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-label\">本格可到 i + nums[i]</div><div class=\"stat-value local-reach\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-label\">全局最远可达</div><div class=\"stat-value farthest\">0</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"track-label\">全局可达范围</div><div class=\"bar\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"message\">稍后开始。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"foot\">关键判定：若扫描到 <code>i &gt; 最远可达</code>，当前位置无法抵达，立即得到 <code>false</code>；若最远边界覆盖末尾，立即得到 <code>true</code>。</div>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const cases = [\n    { id: 'case-a', nums: [2,3,1,1,4] },\n    { id: 'case-b', nums: [3,2,1,0,4] }\n  ];\n  const views = cases.map(item => {\n    const root = document.getElementById(item.id);\n    const array = root.querySelector('.array');\n    const bar = root.querySelector('.bar');\n    item.nums.forEach((n, i) => {\n      const cell = document.createElement('div');\n      cell.className = 'cell' + (i === item.nums.length - 1 ? ' target' : '');\n      cell.innerHTML = `<div class=\"value\">${n}</div><div class=\"index\">下标 ${i}</div><div class=\"marker\">当前</div>`;\n      array.appendChild(cell);\n      const segment = document.createElement('div');\n      segment.className = 'segment';\n      bar.appendChild(segment);\n    });\n    return { ...item, root, cells: [...array.children], segments: [...bar.children] };\n  });\n\n  const reset = view => {\n    view.cells.forEach((cell, i) => {\n      cell.className = 'cell' + (i === view.nums.length - 1 ? ' target' : '');\n      const marker = cell.querySelector('.marker');\n      marker.textContent = '';\n      marker.style.color = 'transparent';\n    });\n    view.segments.forEach(s => s.className = 'segment');\n    view.root.querySelector('.current-index').textContent = '—';\n    view.root.querySelector('.local-reach').textContent = '—';\n    view.root.querySelector('.farthest').textContent = '0';\n    view.root.querySelector('.result').className = 'result';\n    view.root.querySelector('.result').textContent = '等待演示';\n    view.root.querySelector('.message').textContent = '等待开始。';\n  };\n\n  const buildFrames = view => {\n    const frames = [];\n    let far = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < view.nums.length; i++) {\n      if (i > far) {\n        frames.push({ i, far, local: null, state: 'fail', text: `下标 ${i} 超过最远边界 ${far}，无法抵达。` });\n        break;\n      }\n      const local = i + view.nums[i];\n      const old = far;\n      far = Math.max(far, local);\n      frames.push({ i, far, local, state: far >= view.nums.length - 1 ? 'success' : 'scan', text: `下标 ${i} 最多到 ${local}；边界由 ${old} 更新为 ${far}。` });\n      if (far >= view.nums.length - 1) break;\n    }\n    return frames;\n  };\n\n  const render = (view, frame) => {\n    view.cells.forEach((cell, i) => {\n      cell.className = 'cell' + (i === view.nums.length - 1 ? ' target' : '');\n      if (i <= frame.far) cell.classList.add('reachable');\n      if (i === frame.i) cell.classList.add(frame.state === 'fail' ? 'blocked' : 'current');\n      cell.querySelector('.marker').textContent = i === frame.i ? (frame.state === 'fail' ? '不可达' : '当前') : '占位';\n      if (i !== frame.i) cell.querySelector('.marker').style.color = 'transparent';\n      else cell.querySelector('.marker').style.color = '';\n    });\n    view.segments.forEach((segment, i) => segment.classList.toggle('on', i <= frame.far));\n    view.root.querySelector('.current-index').textContent = frame.i;\n    view.root.querySelector('.local-reach').textContent = frame.local === null ? '无法检查' : frame.local;\n    view.root.querySelector('.farthest').textContent = frame.far;\n    view.root.querySelector('.message').innerHTML = `<strong>${frame.state === 'fail' ? '边界中断' : frame.state === 'success' ? '已覆盖终点' : '继续扫描'}</strong>：${frame.text}`;\n    const result = view.root.querySelector('.result');\n    if (frame.state === 'success') { result.textContent = 'true'; result.className = 'result done-true'; }\n    else if (frame.state === 'fail') { result.textContent = 'false'; result.className = 'result done-false'; }\n    else { result.textContent = '判断中'; result.className = 'result'; }\n  };\n\n  const timeline = [];\n  views.forEach((view, caseIndex) => {\n    buildFrames(view).forEach(frame => timeline.push({ caseIndex, frame }));\n  });\n  let step = 0;\n  const tick = () => {\n    if (step === 0) views.forEach(reset);\n    const item = timeline[step];\n    render(views[item.caseIndex], item.frame);\n    if (item.caseIndex === 1 && step === timeline.findIndex(x => x.caseIndex === 1)) {\n      views[1].root.querySelector('.result').textContent = '判断中';\n    }\n    step = (step + 1) % timeline.length;\n  };\n  tick();\n  setInterval(tick, 1800);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
,"time_complexity":"O(n)","space_complexity":"O(1)","complexity_note":"n 为数组长度. 每个可达下标最多扫描一次, 只维护最远可达边界, 无须枚举所有跳跃路线."}
